            "review_title": "Review at Geylang Lor 9 Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "Brian O\nSingapore, Singapore58 contributions\n0\nHeart Warming Singaporean Food in HCMC - Highly Recommended 👍\nJun 2022 • Friends\nAs a Singaporean, I have to say that this outlet right smack in District 1 of Ho Chi Minh City has got it right!!! \n\nIf you are looking for an authentic taste of Geylang and craving for frog legs porridge or a piping hot plate of Har Chiong Kai, you will need to make your way here for a meal. \n\nThe set up is simple yet comfortable. The staff are attentive and may even speak a word or two of Malay to you to add on to the Singaporean flavour. \n\nApart from the frog legs porridge (go for the one with chilli), we also had sambal kangkung and 2 servings of Malaysian KL Hokkien Mee. \n\nWill definitely make this a regular stop whenever I am in HCMC. \n\n😊👍👍👍👍\nRead more\nWritten June 30, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
