            "review_title": "Review at Geylang Lor 9 Frog Porridge",
            "review_text": "William C\n1 contribution\n0\nSingapore Delicacy in HCM\nJun 2019\nThis store is founded by a Singaporean. It sells authentic frog porridge. Its taste is similar to those sold in Singapore, but cost less. It is pretty expensive to eat frog porridge in Singapore. The porridge sold here in HCM is just as good as those sold in Singapore. When ordering, I would recommend you ask for the spicy version which taste very much better than the non spicy version. There are also few other side dishes you could consider to order and eat together with the frog porridge. But you can just eat the frog porridge on its own!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2019",
