            "review_text": "_serenaseuk\nManila, Philippines1 contribution\n0\nSticking to Deep Fried Frog Legs\nSep 2018 • Friends\nI'm a fan of deep fried frog legs. Though some of my friends don't like them. They did encourage me to try the frog porridge...a first for me. \n\nIn fairness...the frog porridge was really good. But I'm still sticking to the deep frog legs. \n\nThe price was a bit expensive as what some of my friends have said. Because they can have frog porridge at the other restaurants for a lower price.\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2018",
