            "review_text": "ferdisandthebulls\nFrankston, Australia113 contributions\n0\nLoved it!\nAug 2018 • Couples\nWife and I ate here tonight and really enjoyed it. Full of flavour and nice heat with the sambal. Food arrived in good time and the servings were a good size. We both left full and contented. Three mains, serve of rice each and a drink each came to 540,000 vnd. To me that's great value. Especially considering a pizza place not far away had one pizza for 396,000 vnd. \nI've never tried Singapore food before so can't compare it but we couldn't fault what we ate.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2018",
